# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Copyright-sensitive / third-party game art — never commit these.
# Sprites & berry plot art are fetched by generate_pokemon_mod.py (PokeAPI /
# pret sources). Include them in a local install zip after generating; do not
# push to GitHub.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
assets/
assets-hold/
map_previews/

# Sevii — generated outputs + third-party pret dumps (rebuild locally)
sevii/layout_data.lua
sevii/layout_report.json
sevii/tileset_data.lua
sevii/encounters_data.lua
sevii/trainers_data.lua
sevii/blueprint.json
